              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naomi yavoola, “Yahova agaasizi Boazi! Yahova atwekizaa lisuuvirizwa lilie kazozo ku avaveeye mwoyo, kandi ku yavo avakuzaa.” Naomi yaazizagilira kovora, “Mundu oyo aveeye mulala ku aviiko viitu vahimbi; aveeye mulala ku vandu vinyumba yitu unyala kulinda kunyi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
